#: ../../installation.rst:52
msgid ""
"We recommend people use `docker <https://www.docker.com>`_ for running ODM, "
"whether you are on Windows, macOS or Linux."
msgstr ""
"Pro spuštění ODM doporučujeme používat `docker <https://www.docker.com>`_, "
